#. TRANSLATORS: Property: texts[]
#: cutscenes/1to2/cutscene_1to2.tscn
msgid ""
"We built shrines and chanted ancient prayers.\n"
"We called your name, certain that faith would mend the world."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: texts[]
#: cutscenes/1to2/cutscene_1to2.tscn
msgid ""
"But the earth did not stir. Nor the clouds break.\n"
"The world stayed in pieces, and our faith wavered."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: texts[]
#. Property: text
#: cutscenes/1to2/cutscene_1to2.tscn
#: cutscenes/2to3/cutscene_2to3.tscn
#: cutscenes/3to4/cutscene_3to4.tscn
msgid ""
"If prayer would not restore what was lost, then surely, oh Enlightened One, you could command greater powers.\n"
"Had we not survived by your hand?"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: texts[]
#: cutscenes/1to2/cutscene_1to2.tscn
msgid "We begged for a blessing, but in our hearts, we demanded action."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: texts[]
#: cutscenes/1to2/cutscene_1to2.tscn
msgid "You met our anger not with silence, but with new words and secret signs."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: texts[]
#: cutscenes/1to2/cutscene_1to2.tscn
msgid ""
"We cast aside quiet faith.\n"
"With you to guide us, we would force the world to heal, whether it wished it or not."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: metadata/movie_file
#: cutscenes/1to2/cutscene_1to2.tscn
#: cutscenes/2to3/cutscene_2to3.tscn
#: cutscenes/3to4/cutscene_3to4.tscn
#: cutscenes/demo_end/cutscene_demo_end.tscn
#: cutscenes/intro/cutscene_intro.tscn
#: cutscenes/outro/cutscene_outro.tscn
#: hub/name_scroll_display.tscn
msgid "C:/Users/max99/intro.avi"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: texts[]
#: cutscenes/2to3/cutscene_2to3.tscn
msgid ""
"We studied the wind and commanded the spirits.\n"
"We tapped the hidden powers to force the world whole."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: texts[]
#: cutscenes/2to3/cutscene_2to3.tscn
msgid ""
"But the land trembled beneath our spells, and the spirits turned away.\n"
"Our force only carved deeper wounds into the land."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: texts[]
#: cutscenes/2to3/cutscene_2to3.tscn
msgid ""
"In defeat, we found humility.\n"
"We saw, at last, that force without respect only deepens the rift."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: texts[]
#: cutscenes/2to3/cutscene_2to3.tscn
msgid ""
"Once more we looked to you, oh Enlightened One, to guide us.\n"
"To plead our case before the restless earth, and beg its forgiveness."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: texts[]
#: cutscenes/3to4/cutscene_3to4.tscn
msgid ""
"The grand accord was set in ink and hope, bearing the seal of the Enlightened One.\n"
"We promised, this time, to tread gently upon the land."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: texts[]
#: cutscenes/3to4/cutscene_3to4.tscn
msgid ""
"Like the priests of our ancestors, and the magicians of centuries past, we trusted the Enlightened One.\n"
"We tended the world with care, and slowly, the wounds of old began to heal."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: texts[]
#: cutscenes/3to4/cutscene_3to4.tscn
msgid ""
"For generations, the land nurtured us in return.\n"
"But the shards remained adrift."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: texts[]
#: cutscenes/3to4/cutscene_3to4.tscn
msgid ""
"In time, our ways grew strange to one another.\n"
"Even the language we shared no longer connects us."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: texts[]
#: cutscenes/3to4/cutscene_3to4.tscn
msgid ""
"We kept our gardens tended, but left the gates untraveled.\n"
"What good are new beginnings, when the world has been doomed for generations?"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: texts[]
#: cutscenes/3to4/cutscene_3to4.tscn
msgid "We live in the shadow of memory, and memory too is fading."
msgstr ""

