#. TRANSLATORS: Property: texts[]
#. Property: text
#: cutscenes/intro/cutscene_intro.tscn
msgid "Once, we were the masters of our world..."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: texts[]
#: cutscenes/intro/cutscene_intro.tscn
msgid "Trees bowed to our axes. Beasts and rivers alike ran where we willed."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: texts[]
#: cutscenes/intro/cutscene_intro.tscn
msgid "We carved up the earth and took our rightful inheritance."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: texts[]
#: cutscenes/intro/cutscene_intro.tscn
msgid "But divine favor would not last forever."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: texts[]
#: cutscenes/intro/cutscene_intro.tscn
msgid "Droughts scorched our fields and winds wailed against our shelters."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: texts[]
#: cutscenes/intro/cutscene_intro.tscn
msgid "We fought back with cunning and miracles, to quell the shaking land."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: texts[]
#: cutscenes/intro/cutscene_intro.tscn
msgid "And in our struggle, we shattered what we treasured most."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: texts[]
#: cutscenes/intro/cutscene_intro.tscn
msgid "All that remains is ten thousand shards, adrift upon the wind."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: texts[]
#: cutscenes/intro/cutscene_intro.tscn
msgid "Among us were some who listened to your words, oh Enlightened One, and prepared for the end."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: texts[]
#: cutscenes/intro/cutscene_intro.tscn
msgid "We inked our names upon a great scroll, shielding us from the Shattering."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: texts[]
#: cutscenes/intro/cutscene_intro.tscn
msgid "With our faith rewarded, we set out to reunite the world."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: cutscenes/intro/cutscene_intro.tscn
msgid "to continue..."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: cutscenes/intro/cutscene_intro.tscn
msgid "Click to continue..."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: texts[]
#: cutscenes/outro/cutscene_outro.tscn
msgid "Now one could forget the first Calendar Day."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: texts[]
#: cutscenes/outro/cutscene_outro.tscn
msgid "Every shard had its own stall in the square. No two dishes tasted the same, and no two songs shared a style."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: texts[]
#: cutscenes/outro/cutscene_outro.tscn
msgid "Where once we grieved old memories, we now compared plans."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: texts[]
#: cutscenes/outro/cutscene_outro.tscn
msgid "We opened a fresh scroll, and marked the first day of the new year."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: texts[]
#: cutscenes/outro/cutscene_outro.tscn
msgid "We did not forget the sins of our ancestors, but from this day on, we started looking ahead."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: texts[]
#. Property: text
#: cutscenes/outro/cutscene_outro.tscn
msgid "When the sun rose again, there was still work to be done. Life, as always, was woven from a thousand small labors."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: texts[]
#: cutscenes/outro/cutscene_outro.tscn
msgid "Some lived out their lives on one shard, content with a place they could call home."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: texts[]
#: cutscenes/outro/cutscene_outro.tscn
msgid "Others set out, ready to begin again, in the countless worlds yet to be discovered."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: texts[]
#: cutscenes/outro/cutscene_outro.tscn
msgid "But no matter what each of us did, we all learned to treasure our ten thousand worlds upon the wind."
msgstr ""

