#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark.gd:58
#: settings/control_binding_setting.gd:59
#: shard_types/mq_forest_shrine/shard_type_mq_forest_shrine.tres
#: shard_types/mq_foxes/shard_type_mq_foxes.tres
#: shard_types/mq_lake_shrine/shard_type_mq_lake_shrine.tres
msgid "..."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "If we are to hear the Enlightened One's voice again, we must consecrate holy relics in this strange new world."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "To live on the shards we must know the shards."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "A capital must guide the people, just as the Enlightened One guides us all."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "We must gather the leaves of the tree of Enlightenment for those who come after."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "The shrines will guide our people to the Enlightened One's wisdom."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "We must attune the Enlightened One's grace, for it is the only thing that can mend the world."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "We must find the veins where the world's pulse is strongest, and harness their power!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "The foul spirits of the New World are restless, but the Enlightened One's holy glyphs will protect us!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "The Enlightened One's power is almost in our grasp!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "My predecessors refused to listen, but I will not repeat their mistakes."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "We must listen to the voice of the Enlightened One in the silence of the wilderness."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "The Enlightened One has always been beside us, in the beasts that we so foolishly spurned."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "If ever there was a beast noble enough to embody the Enlightened One's spirit, it would have to be the dragon..."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "It is time for us to nurture the land, for it is as the Enlightened One said: \"When the ground heals, from the roots the sapling sprouts.\""
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "The age of Reunification has begun."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "We must build a home worthy of the Enlightened One reborn."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "The Historian is wise, but even the wise are oft misguided."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "So many sacred texts yet left to study..."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "We must be careful with powers we don't yet understand."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "How are we to understand these hauntings when no two reports can agree on the details?"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "There's no way a few glyphs can put the whole world back together..."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "History is made by humans, but there's much to learn from nature as well..."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Those monks will have a lot of time to study, out in the wilderness."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Oh, I can't wait to have a fox companion!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I haven't seen a single reputable historical source supporting the existence of dragons..."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I don't know if visions are a reliable source of truth, but enshrining a vow to protect the environment is certainly a great idea."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "The Scribe keeps going on about Reunification again, as if history hadn't already proven that it's a hopeless dream."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "The Scribe's been awfully private lately. Won't even let me come into his studio."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Oh, this is going to shed so much light on pre-Shattering religious customs!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "We must prevent the rise of tyranny, no matter how well-meaning its roots."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "How can one Historian record the stories from all these shards..."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I can't wait to explore all these new lands!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I didn't realize we'd be building a capital just based on my little surveys..."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I should get a Dare glyph tattooed on my back!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "We'll get those shrines set up in no time!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "The new temple will look amazing! I bet it'll become a pilgrim magnet!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Finding veins of power: now that's what I call an adventure!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I wonder why I've never encountered a haunting before, despite all my adventures..."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I like excitement and all, but these rituals are beginning to get a little strange..."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I love an excuse for getting lost in the wilderness!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "If I ever retired to a monastery, the Monastery of the Wilds would definitely be my choice."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I wonder what manner of strange beast we will encounter..."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I should get myself an animal companion too. A monkey, maybe? Or a snake! No one else has a snake!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I wish I could've seen that dragon spirit! Why is it that only priests get to talk to spirits?"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "The border between those two shards has gotta be a crazy sight!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Do a guy one favor and he starts expecting you to run his every errand."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I wonder how the Scribe is doing..."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Most of these speeches are really going over my head..."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Another shard off the list! So many more still left to visit..."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "The clouds here are much fluffier than back home!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Father speaks so convincingly, but so does the Historian..."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "How could I not have seen it before..."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "What should I make for dinner tonight?"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Sometimes I just want to sit on the edge of a shard and swing my feet over the side."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Everything about the Haven feels so similar, yet so different at the same time."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I wonder if my true love is on another shard... maybe I should join the next expedition."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "That cloud looks like a fox... no, a badger... hmm..."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I wonder if anyone's tried sailing on the Cloud Sea yet..."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "If I waved at that shard, would anyone see me? I wonder..."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I wonder if other shards are this noisy."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "The weather sure has been nice recently. If only it could stay like this forever."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Maybe if we put little bits of warabi into tea... would people drink it?"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "What's this flower called? We didn't have these on my shard."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "What a bold hairstyle!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I could really go for a cup of tea right now."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I hope someday I get to see a fish turn into a dragon."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Do you think humans and spirits can be friends?"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Only the highest quality merchandise here!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "These are a specialty of my shard!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "These are all I could save from the destruction of my home shard."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I love sitting here watching the fishes..."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "No other shard will ever feel like home..."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Ugh... The heat here is suffocating."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Hmm... What if we draw the Fire glyph next to the Wind glyph..."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I wonder if drawing a Water glyph on my umbrella will keep the rain off."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I can't wait for the expedition to depart..."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Ugh, I can't believe they would serve such mushy noodles!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Did I pack enough sandals for the expedition?"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I put my rice ball down for one second, and a fox just walked off with it."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I wonder which shard those birds come from..."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "If I drop a stone off the edge, will it keep dropping forever?"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I wonder what happens to rivers that run off the edge into the Cloud Sea..."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I wonder if the stars look any different from other shards..."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "It's strange to think that every stone we walk on used to be attached to the rest of the earth."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I wonder if the fish know the world is broken..."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "When the Enlightened One puts the world back together, I hope my old village ends up next to a river."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "We just need to pray a little harder..."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "The Enlightened One will knit the world back into a single piece any day now."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "If I keep my pack light, it'll be easier to walk home once the shards are back together."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "It is as the Enlightened One said: \"You will be left to put the shards back together.\""
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "It is as the Enlightened One said: \"The spirit gives heat and burns no wood.\""
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "It is as the Enlightened One said: \"When there is no wood, the fire goes out.\""
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "It is as the Enlightened One said: \"When the elder sees the cicada leave its shell, she is enlightened.\""
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "It is as the Enlightened One said: \"When the ground heals, from the roots the sapling sprouts.\""
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "When I dream of my home shard, do you think I really go there?"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Could I be a butterfly dreaming that I am a person?"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I'm glad I was able to rescue my diary... I hope no one finds it."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I had to leave all the poems I wrote behind... I hope someone finds them someday."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Sometimes the clouds almost seem to flow like water."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "What must it have been like, to simply walk to the next town over?"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Maybe I'll see the shards reunited in my next life."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Do you think people remember each other when they're reborn?"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Must be nice to be a bird."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "What do you think is at the bottom of the Cloud Sea? I think it's a palace full of dragons."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I wish I could understand what the wind whispers to the leaves."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "The dew is heavy today."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Could it be that others, too, lost their way like this?"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I never know what to expect from each new dawn."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Some days it's hard to see the forest for the bamboo."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "What strange times these are..."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "One's footprints are so easily erased."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Some days I'm overwhelmed with yearning for my home shard."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Does it ever get easier?"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "To love another is to be part of something greater than yourself."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I look forward to the day when we don't have to use the gates to see each other."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Maybe I'll do a wisteria design next..."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Even the birdsong is different here."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I can never manage to get the Cultivate glyph quite right."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Don't go near the edge when the fog rolls in."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Someday I'll tame that monkey."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Does it have five strokes or six there? I can never remember."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I wonder if the Scribe would let me study under him."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I wonder if the Historian would let me study under her."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "This inkstone has been in my family for generations."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Oh no! I think I stepped on a bug... I'm sorry, little one."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "The new incense the latest expedition brought back is heavenly!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I just can't seem to get soup to taste the way my mother used to make it."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "The refugees that just came in brought some excellent clay with them."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I wonder what kinds of clay exist on other shards? Maybe I should join the next expedition."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I need to keep my body lower..."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "We dance to welcome the spirits of the dead."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "We dance to mimic a sparrow's flight."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "We dance to remember our history."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I've never seen that dance style before... I have so much to learn from the other refugees."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Other shards [i]must[/i] admire the wisteria as much as we do. It's only civilized..."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "What kinds of poems do they write on other shards?"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I hope my reading goes well tonight."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Through flowers, we love."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I think this might be my best verse yet!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "No, no, that line simply won't do..."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I bring news."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Message for the Scribe!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Message for the Historian!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Every creature can attain enlightenment."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Ginseng, for energy."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Ginger, for digestion."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Ginger, for circulation."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Peony, for the blood."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Cinnamon, for circulation."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Licorice, for respiration."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Licorice, for reducing toxicity."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Licorice, for harmony."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Bai Zhi herb, for blood."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Bai Zhi herb, for women."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Okera root, for water retention."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Hare's Ear root, for the liver."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Green Dragon root, for phlegm."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Yellow Horse stem, for decongestion."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "That style of decoration looks so familiar somehow..."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I can't believe I found a truffle today!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Should I keep this matsutake for myself, or should I sell it? Decisions..."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "The rice crop looks good this year."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I hope we get more rain soon."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Hmm... storm's coming."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Oooh, a storm's coming!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Tonight's going to be my first performance. I'm nervous..."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "What is it about that scene that makes it so hard to remember the lines?"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "The play is really coming together."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I can't wait to play this part in front of an audience!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I finally landed the role!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I love it when rehearsals go so well."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Well, that rehearsal couldn't have gone much worse..."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "They chose well for the leading role... I hope that's me someday."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "There's nothing like a successful performance!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Last night was great! I can't wait to play that part again."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Ugh, I hope the Historian erases that play from her records..."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Whatever the new refugees are cooking smells positively divine."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "It's hard to believe people have been performing that play for hundreds of years now."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "This dish is missing something... what would go well with lotus root?"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "So many different kinds of tea... I want to try them all!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Too much ginger!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Mmm... these bamboo shoots are perfect."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I saw a gigantic radish in the market the other day. I wonder what I could make with such a thing."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I'm glad I don't have to rush about like that anymore."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "The idea of packing up and moving to a new shard at my age is exhausting."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Hot!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Look at the shape of this taro... it almost seems a shame to cut it up."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Everything's better with spring chrysanthemum thrown in."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "There are truffles at the market! I'd better get there before they sell out."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "The other day, I saw someone who'd stuffed a ball of rice flour with red bean paste. How intriguing..."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I think this new color will be a hit!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I hope the new refugees brought some of whatever plant they used to achieve that color."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I just can't quite seem to get that red quite right."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Ugh, I've put this cloth through so many dye baths already!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "You really have to be patient to dye cloth."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I'm so glad that green is a color one can wear year-round."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I think this new shibori style will be popular!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I tore my chrysanthemum stencil the other day... now I have to make a new one."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "New horizons await!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I want to see all the shards."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Towns are so crowded. I can't wait to get back to exploring."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "There's nothing like camping... but sometimes, sleeping in a proper bed [i]is[/i] nice."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Money isn't everything... but I do always hope I find some treasure while I'm out there."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I don't understand how some people can stay in one place for their whole lives."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I've seen so much of what the shards have to offer... but I've still never seen a spirit!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I hope I see a spirit someday..."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I found some impressive ruins on my last journey... how strange, to think that there were people there so long ago."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "It's hard to keep track of which shards you've been to when they keep shifting around."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "The Historian's going to have to build another warehouse to hold all my old maps."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "The new batch of sake is almost ready!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Every shard has a new type of sake rice... the variety is astounding."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Every shard has a new type of sake yeast... the variety is astounding."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I need to tell my apprentice to polish the rice more. This isn't ordinary table rice!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "These new refugees have never heard of sake [i]at all[/i]?! Oh, Enlightened One! How uncivilized!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I should ask the Explorer to bring me water from that shard again. It gave the sake the perfect balance of sweetness."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I think the yeast affects the flavor of the sake even more than the rice, actually."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I always save a cask of my best sake to send the expeditions off."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I prefer a sweeter sake... it's a shame bitter sake is so popular right now."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Finally! The sake tastes just like how my mother used to make it!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Do you think spirits appreciate sake as much as we do?"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I've heard tales of a legendary spring that produces sake instead of water. I'd love to see it someday."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "By the Enlightened One, it's like every shard has a different type of salt! I had no idea there could be so many."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "The seaweed gives the salt a perfect umami flavor."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "These clay pans could revolutionize the salt production process!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "It takes so long to dry the seaweed... and then for salt to form on the seaweed... sigh."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "No one has any idea how much effort it takes to make salt. They just take it for granted..."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "What if I boiled the seawater? Would it leave all the salt behind?... No, that would take too long."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "If only it didn't rain so much... the seaweed would dry more quickly then."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "So many varieties of salt out there... but the best one is the salt from the water here at the Haven."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I wonder if there's a place where salt comes from the earth... or maybe the sky!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "This salt will be perfect for pickling plums."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "This salt will be perfect for pickling radishes."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "This salt will be perfect for pickling carrots."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "This salt will be perfect for pickling cucumbers."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Today is a good day to take a risk."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Today is a bad day to take a risk."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "With the elixir of immortality, I'd never have to worry about running out of time to see all the shards!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "The stars are in an auspicious position today."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "The harvest looks good this year... all thanks to my ritual."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "It's about time to perform the ritual to ward off disease for the winter..."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Alchemy is about purifying the spirit... and ideally living forever. Someday."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I have to collect firewood deliveries for the bathhouse every day."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Keeping the bath at just the right temperature is a challenge, but I like it."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I can't take my eyes off the boiler for a second."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Some of these hairstyles are so hard to learn..."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "It's not about how many backs you wash. It's about how well you wash them."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I had to massage a guard the other day... my hands are so sore. How do they get their muscles that tough?"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I had to massage a scholar the other day... it's so hard not to ask them about their work."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I had to massage a bureaucrat the other day... I wonder if the bathhouse is the only place they get any sleep."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I had to massage an adventurer the other day... She told me all kinds of strange things about bathhouses on other shards."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I had to massage a cook the other day... the smells they bring in always make me so hungry."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "About time to start the planting for the next season."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "It's amazing how all the shards seem to have such similar flowers, even after all this time."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Gotta keep an eye on these new refugees..."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Quiet day today."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Busy day today."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I almost wish something suspicious would happen..."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I wonder if I'll ever get to fight a spirit."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Who do you think would win in a fight: a guard or a magician?"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "It's my duty to protect the settlers."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Did the Enlightened One need guarding like this?"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "There's always bound to be conflict when two shards meet."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Keeping the peace in the market is always hard work..."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I can't believe a swarm of bees crossed the Cloud Sea! How did they know we were here?"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "What happens to the bees the refugees leave behind, I wonder?"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "The honey tastes better if you use a higher-quality box."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Lately, the refugees have started bringing honey as an offering for the Scribe and the Historian... It's been great for business!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Subtle differences in honey can have a surprising effect on the perfumes they're used in."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Thank the Enlightened One that smoke is so effective at calming the swarm."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "You don't need some kind of fancy wooden box to house your bees. Just find a hollow tree or a big piece of bamboo."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I don't know how something as small as a bee survives the harsh winters."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I know why humans dance. But why do bees dance?"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I'm pretty sure my swarm killed a giant hornet the other day... scary."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Charcoal seems humble, but the fanciest crafts couldn't exist without it."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Having to live near the kiln sure gets lonely sometimes."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "More settlers means more demand for charcoal... I hope we don't run out of wood."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I wonder if we could set aside some shards just for extra wood."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Every type of wood burns differently. You have to know the trees well to do it right."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "It's always such a long trip into town..."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Did the Haven have this many people last time I visited?"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I should find an apprentice soon... but can anyone really understand the kiln like I do?"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I hope it doesn't rain as much on the new shard. I hate having to work in the rain."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Like the shifting shards, life is ever-changing."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I wonder how many shards the migrating birds have seen... Have they glimpsed truths we are yet to discover?"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "We are all adrift on our rocky ships in the Cloud Sea..."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I wonder how life has branched out, isolated as it is on each shard."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "The world is obviously cone-shaped!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Does the rain come from the waterfalls of other shards?"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I want to travel to study the farming practices of all the different shards!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Do shards of the same size float at the same height?"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I have made many friends along the way, but partings never get easier."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I miss the friends from my home shard."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I deliver mail between five shards! Nothing beats the joy of bridging far-off hearts."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I'll work on the new shard to support my family back home. I miss them dearly."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "May the Enlightened One keep us safe from the storms."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "By the Enlightened One, what a beautiful day!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I used to make a lot of swords... not much use for those in the New World."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "The iron on new shards takes some getting used to."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I have to repair so many sickles before it's time for the harvest."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Me? I really like making teapots."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "It's always satisfying to take something worn out and make it like new again."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Even a simple knife blade needs to be folded so many times..."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "The new apprentice is great at polishing. What a relief; I've never liked that part."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "If only there was some way to standardize laws between shards..."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Young people these days just don't know how to fill out forms."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "The more refugees we get, the more forms we have to add..."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I spend so much time at the office these days..."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "The chisels I ordered are ready to pick up."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "One badly-carved joint can bring the whole building down."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I have to sharpen my saw soon."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "If you think about it, the chisel and the plane are just tiny swords..."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "It's the steel that lets our woodwork be so precise."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I hear some shards have buildings that are hundreds of years old, but whoever built them used the exact same techniques I do."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I like working in the gardens. The plants never want to talk to me."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Ahh... it's hot."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I still have to decide where to put the new cherry tree..."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Gardening isn't just about the plants. It's about the water between the plants."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "The gardens and the buildings need to coexist in harmony."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I'm glad I never have to go out on the pond. I'm afraid of boats..."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "How many times do I have to tell them? The maple goes in the [i]southwest[/i]."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "The wisterias look great this year."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "My cat companion wrecked my latest batch of sake cups... days of work wasted."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I hope my son keeps the mill running when I'm gone."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Pests ate so much of the harvest this year... I hope next year will be better."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Husking rice takes up so much time..."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I wonder if I'll ever get to try this white rice someday."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "The carver outdid herself with this one."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "The crop came in late this year."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "The crop came in early this year."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "A good hat never goes out of style."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "So many people forget that each hat wants a different hairstyle to go with it."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "A person's hat can tell you a lot about them."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Is there really such a thing as too much lacquer when it comes to fashion?"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "My daughter will be able to work with silk soon! They grow up so fast..."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "My bamboo hats are the sturdiest in the city!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I've seen a lot of broken ties recently... was the cloth bad, or did I sew them wrong somehow?"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Bah, pests got into the rice straw. I won't be able to make any new hats until I get more."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "The most important lesson for a new porter? It's to respect the mountain."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I do more than just carry things... but carrying is a big part of the work."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "This pack? About twice my weight!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Each new expedition is a good excuse to get out of the city for a while."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I wonder what it's like to stay on the same shard your whole life."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I'm ready to go!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I love the wilderness as much as anyone... but sometimes I wonder why a person feels the need to live so far from anyone else."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Another expedition already? Feels like I just sat down..."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Children these days..."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "The city's best poet wrote a poem about my latest blend! I'm so happy!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Incense should be comfortable in small amounts, and shouldn't be unpleasant when used in abundance."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "The price of sandalwood is painful lately! I hope they find a shard with plenty more soon."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "The incense-making tradition has been passed down for centuries..."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Is there a shard somewhere that's less humid than this?"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "The Scribe is one of my best customers... I hope the Enlightened One likes the scents I make."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I wonder if the Enlightened One has a favorite scent."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "The Scribe can be intense sometimes..."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "So many pilgrims have been coming to visit the Enlightened One's Abode recently..."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Where in the shards is the new tatami I ordered?"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "When my son takes over the inn, maybe I'll go to a new shard and start another inn there."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "What if you drew the designs in lacquer [i]first[/i], and [i]then[/i] dusted them with metal powders? Hmmm."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Chrysanthemum designs have been popular recently..."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "The expeditions' sketches are always inspiring!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I got distracted while taking sap from the lacquer tree and got some on my skin... now I itch all over."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Ahh! A big spider!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I keep leaving out trinkets, but I still haven't befriended a crow companion yet..."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "This is always a busy time of year."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Do people on other shards value the same things we do in a match?"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Is it possible to compare lineages from a different shard to our own? Maybe I should ask the Explorer to take notes."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Maybe we're not as different as we think."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I helped that couple find each other years ago... of course they're still doing well."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I helped seventy couples find each other last year, and only three broke up."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Nothing is as satisfying as bringing a good match together."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "What's the exchange rate today?"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "The markets on other shards are so much bigger than my home shard's..."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "New wares, from the furthest reaches of the Cloud Sea!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "You won't find a better deal anywhere in the Cloud Sea!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "My prices are the best on any shard."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Living on a hot spring is a dream... I should hire more apprentices so I have more time to myself."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Even the monkeys visit the hot springs in the winter."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "The innkeeper commissioned a painting of the monkeys in the hot springs recently... do you think the monkeys will mind if I'm watching them?"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Every landscape has its own beauty."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I ran out of paint on my last expedition, and the locals had no idea what I was talking about! What shard hasn't heard of paint?"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "We study fracture to understand unity."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Copper tarnishes with time, and so does memory. We must polish both."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "We contemplate the canyon to see the layers of the Old World."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "To build a bridge between two cliffs is a step towards unity."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Some look at a canyon and see a divide. We look at it and see where the world used to fit together."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "To put a bowl back together, you must first gather all the pieces."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Unity is a daily effort."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Our copper rings are unadorned, for truth needs no decoration."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "We have to accept that there are things we cannot accept."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Hard practice will help you free yourself from useless thoughts."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Our copper rings are circles to remind us that every end is a beginning."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "You cannot understand the whole unless you study the pieces."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "My copper ring reminds me that we are all connected. It also leaves a green mark on my finger."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "The mountain's heat burns away hesitation, leaving only resolve behind."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "It's nice to have a bowl of tea with no ash once in a while."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "The charcoal bead is wood that endured the fire. We must do the same."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "To shape the world you must be willing to burn your fingers."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Some wait for the world to heal. We forge the tools to reshape it ourselves."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Resolve is like a fire, extinguished if not fed."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "One may forget scripture, but one cannot forget a walk over glowing coals."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Enlightenment is in the sweat on your brow when the work is done."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "We feel the divine power in the heat of the stones."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "One must weed one's thoughts much like a garden."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Our seed pouches carry the promise of future growth."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "We plant seeds to remind ourselves that patience is a virtue."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "A forest needs no map to find its way. It merely reaches for the light."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "A seed pouch weighs nothing, yet it holds an entire forest."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "You cannot pull on a sapling to make it grow faster."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "A healthy tree supports the whole grove."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "The root does not care about the shape of the leaf."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "For a seed to sprout, it must accept the darkness of the ground."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Every dead leaf feeds the forest of tomorrow."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "The scent of pine makes me contemplate the Old World."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Animals do not care about the past. A lesson for the other orders."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "The scent of wild sage clears the mind like no ancient text."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Enlightenment is found in the rustle of the brush."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "The boar reads no scriptures, yet it knows exactly where the roots grow."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Enlightenment is walking through the thorn bushes until the thorns no longer matter."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "If we are to find enlightenment inside us, we must start looking outside first."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "A sleeping fox holds more wisdom than a debating scholar."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Ours is the oldest of the Orders."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "No one's ever found seaweed in the Cloud Sea. What kind of sea is it?"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "The seaweed that new group brought in looks just like ours... but ours tastes better."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I'm so used to keeping an eye out for sea urchins that I catch myself looking for them on land too."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I could never live away from the beach."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "There's something special about the first harvest of the year."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "The secret to growing seaweed? Move the stakes into the river."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "It's almost time to set out the bamboo branches. Seaweed will grow on anything..."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "The mud is nice and cool on a hot day."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "It's hard to believe silkworms depend entirely on us for survival."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "My silkworms are the healthiest!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I found leaves in the silkworm feed that would have poisoned them! Is someone trying to sabotage me?"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Our roof hasn't needed replacing since my grandfather's time..."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Old thatch becomes mulch that feeds the grass that makes new thatch."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "A good, solid roof over our heads is what sets us apart from animals."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "The storm last night didn't damage a single roof. Job well done!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Thatch keeps a house cool in the summer and warm in the winter."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "The roofs on my cousin's shard look so shallow compared to ours... don't they get snow?"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "The surveyors found a huge silver mine on the last expedition... I never thought I would leave my shard, but maybe I should."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Some say the Scribe's teapot dates from the time of the Enlightened One... I wish he would let me study it."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I've always been partial to the rock pattern style of decoration."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "How did the old smiths get that color of patina?"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Silver must be thoroughly cleaned before patination, but you can't forget the last step: scrub it with a radish. It's an old secret."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "My worms are sick, and I don't know what it is... did the new immigrants bring a disease?"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Low on mulberry already... they're so small, but they eat so much!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Only the best leaves for my little silkworms!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I want to collect stories from all the different shards."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Long, long ago..."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Listen well!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Stories can teach as well as entertain."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "The greatest gift I can give is to pass what I've learned to the next generation."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I love seeing people learn new things."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Even if you're a teacher, you should never assume you know everything."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Even if you're a teacher, you should always strive to keep learning."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Nothing really prepares you for the smell you get when you boil a piece."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "My favorite design is the maple leaf."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "How would you like your very own relic from the time of the Enlightened One? You'll find no better price!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I finally have time to travel the shards."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Quality fabric doesn't happen quickly."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "It's good weather for foraging."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Shiitake make the best broth."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "The best mushrooms are found deep in the woods. The serenity of the environment enhances the flavor."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I've come to pray to the Enlightened One for successful births in the year ahead."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "The bond between mother and child is strengthened through the mother's labor."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I may be old, but I deliver life."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "That was a difficult labor... thank the Enlightened One both the mother and child are all right."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "A woman needs to have discipline while she's pregnant."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "A woman needs to eat properly while she's pregnant."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "A woman needs to keep a tranquil heart while she's pregnant."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Wherever you go in the shards, all babies are born the same."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "The skills I use have been passed down for generations."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I hear the Enlightened One invented paper... is it really possible we get all our knowledge from them?"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Gampi is resistant to both damp and insects, but it's so rare. And it's hard to cultivate... sigh."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "The cold air, the cold water, the sun reflecting off the snow... winter is the best time of year to make paper."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Make sure the water is pure! Any impurities in the water will ruin the final result."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Only the finest paper for the Scribe and the Historian!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Mulberry makes the strongest paper."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Rice feeds our bellies, but mulberry feeds our culture."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "My father harvested the exact same mulberry plants..."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "A design of the Enlightened One leading the first expedition into the New World... yes..."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "That paper maker promised to give me paper like the Scribe or Historian might use. What a liar!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I'm here to petition the Scribe to let me reprint his scrolls. Everyone should be able to read their wisdom!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Use oil to make the lines on the paper more visible against the wood block."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Cherry wood is the best wood to use in printmaking."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "A good print lets you feel like you're visiting another shard without ever leaving your house!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Monochrome prints are elegant, and multicolor prints are amazing. Each approach is beautiful!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Is there anything better than printing books? I think not."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "♪ Arriving at the shrine, what will you pray for? ♪"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "♪ What destiny has made me to row the boat to haul pearls? ♪"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid ""
"♪ Oh come here and see\n"
"The heads of rice have matured\n"
"And bow low with fruit ♪"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "♪ Sake, you drink it, drink it! ♪"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I hear one shard uses a koto with [i]seventeen[/i] strings!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "The shakuhachi was lost for so long... How wonderful that we found it again!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "When I weave, I become part of the loom... literally. The warp yarns are strapped to my back. I adjust the tension with my body."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "This weave is so tight, it's windproof."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "It can take over a month to weave a bolt, but the final result is worth it."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Those magicians don't know anything. Watching the pattern form in a weave is the real magic."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Slubs give a fabric personality."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "We traditionally wear white when we dive. It represents purity... and wards off sharks."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "My grandmother taught me how to dive when I was twelve. She was still diving into her seventies."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "A diver's headscarf brings luck and wards off evil. I hope it works on land too."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I thank the Enlightened One for my safe return after every dive."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "When you hear a long whistle, that means a diver's back!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Spiritual cleanliness is what let us escape the Shattering."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Clean your environment, and you clean your soul too."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Cleaning lets you be more mindful of your space."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "You! Yes, you! When was the last time you cleaned your room?"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Cleaning your body keeps you healthy. Cleaning your surroundings shows care for others."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "My home shard has a sea that's so big you can't see the other side."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "♪ Put your backs into it! Heave, ho! Heave, ho! ♪"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I've seen the whole shard thanks to the rivers."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I've seen spirits you wouldn't believe!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Listen to the stones."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Stack the rocks right, and they'll stay up forever. They'll even survive an earthquake!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "The right stones are shaped like the blossoms of the burdock plant."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Some call the filler pebbles chestnuts, because they're so small. But pebbles are small too, and we don't call chestnuts pebbles instead."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "You get a feel for how the stones will fit together, after a while."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "I hear the last expedition found a big copper mine on the new shard. I should see if they need workers."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "If we dig deep enough, will we come out in the Cloud Sea?"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Nothing like a hot bath after a day of digging."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/barks/bark_db.tres
msgid "Iron's fine and all, but I hope I find silver someday. Maybe even gold!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: dialogue/bubble/speech_bubble.tscn
msgid "Have you noticed the birds? Have you noticed the birds?"
msgstr ""

