#. TRANSLATORS: Property: record_title
#: quests/main/phase1/1_10_tutorial/dlg_quest_main_1_10_tutorial_begin.tres
msgid "Era 一: The First Step"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: quests/main/phase1/1_10_tutorial/dlg_quest_main_1_10_tutorial_begin.tres
msgid ""
"PAGE: monk(NONE), teo(NONE)\n"
"monk: Please look kindly on us as we step out, oh Enlightened One.\n"
"monk: We only need a foothold in this strange new land.\n"
"monk: Just so the others can feel safe when they follow.\n"
"monk: You have already saved us from the Shattering, so I trust that you'll guide us to restore the world.\n"
"monk: I know you have better things to do than watch our every footstep, but if you nudge us in the right direction, we'll handle the rest."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: record_title
#: quests/main/phase1/1_10_tutorial/dlg_quest_main_1_10_tutorial_end.tres
msgid "Era 一: The First Step 二"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: quests/main/phase1/1_10_tutorial/dlg_quest_main_1_10_tutorial_end.tres
msgid ""
"PAGE: monk(NONE), teo(NONE)\n"
"monk: My heart is full, oh Enlightened One!\n"
"monk: Thank you for seeing us through.\n"
"monk: We are exhausted now, so we're going to rest and get used to our new home.\n"
"monk: To think... I was actually there.\n"
"monk: The very first time we stepped back out into the world.\n"
"monk: Tales of this journey will be told for generations.\n"
"monk: It won't be me on the next expedition, but I know you will look after my sisters and brothers just as you have looked after us.\n"
"monk: No doubt is left in my heart that soon you will restore the world to its former glory."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: first_foray_tutorial_text
#: quests/main/phase1/1_10_tutorial/quest_main_1_10_tutorial.tres
msgid ""
"Time to decide how to develop this land. Each <term:spot> offers several <term:spot_upgrade>s, but only one can be active at each level.\n"
"\n"
"Activate some <term_lower:spot_upgrade>s then click Redraw Hand."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: first_foray_tutorial_text_steam_deck
#: quests/main/phase1/1_10_tutorial/quest_main_1_10_tutorial.tres
msgid ""
"Time to decide how to develop this land. Each <term:spot> offers several <term:spot_upgrade>s, but only one can be active at each level.\n"
"\n"
"Activate some <term_lower:spot_upgrade>s then choose Redraw Hand."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: end_foray_tutorial_text
#: quests/main/phase1/1_10_tutorial/quest_main_1_10_tutorial.tres
msgid "When you are done, click End Foray."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: end_foray_tutorial_text_steam_deck
#: quests/main/phase1/1_10_tutorial/quest_main_1_10_tutorial.tres
msgid "When you are done, choose End Foray."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: stage_selector_tutorial_text
#: quests/main/phase1/1_10_tutorial/quest_main_1_10_tutorial.tres
msgid ""
"For the next <term_lower:foray>, we'll need to fulfill the <term_lower:stage_goal> of\n"
"%s.\n"
"\n"
"When selecting a place to settle, pay attention to how much of the goal <term_lower:bonus> it can provide.\n"
"\n"
"You can pan the map using the right mouse button or WASD."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: stage_selector_tutorial_text_steam_deck
#: quests/main/phase1/1_10_tutorial/quest_main_1_10_tutorial.tres
msgid ""
"For the next <term_lower:foray>, we'll need to fulfill the <term_lower:stage_goal> of\n"
"%s.\n"
"\n"
"When selecting a place to settle, pay attention to how much of the goal <term_lower:bonus> it can provide.\n"
"\n"
"You can pan the map using [img width=1.5em height=1.5em]res://utils/input_icons/shared_lstick_md.png[/img]."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: inspiration_tutorial_text
#: quests/main/phase1/1_10_tutorial/quest_main_1_10_tutorial.tres
msgid ""
"This is your <term:inspiration>.\n"
"\n"
"Missing <term_lower:stage_goal>s reduces it.\n"
"\n"
"If you run out, the <term_lower:run>\n"
"ends and you forfeit bonus rewards."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: bonus_listing_tutorial_text
#: quests/main/phase1/1_10_tutorial/quest_main_1_10_tutorial.tres
msgid ""
"The <term_lower:bonus>s you gain during\n"
"<term_lower:foray>s are added up here.\n"
"\n"
"These will unlock new options\n"
"later in the <term_lower:run>."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: third_foray_tutorial_text
#: quests/main/phase1/1_10_tutorial/quest_main_1_10_tutorial.tres
msgid ""
"Anytime between <term_lower:foray>s, you can finish the <term_lower:run>.\n"
"\n"
"If you do this before running out of <term:inspiration>, you will gain a bonus reward.\n"
"\n"
"[b]Let's finish the current expedition![/b]"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: name
#: quests/main/phase1/1_10_tutorial/quest_main_1_10_tutorial.tres
msgid "The First Step"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: goals[]
#: quests/main/phase1/1_10_tutorial/quest_main_1_10_tutorial.tres
msgid "Finish your first <term:run> with at least one <term:settlement> established."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: record_title
#: quests/main/phase1/1_15_relics/dlg_quest_main_1_15_relics_begin.tres
msgid "Era 一: The Relics"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: quests/main/phase1/1_15_relics/dlg_quest_main_1_15_relics_begin.tres
msgid ""
"PAGE: scribe(SHRINE_PRIMARY), teo(SHRINE_SECONDARY)\n"
"scribe: I have served all my life as your Scribe of Names, oh Enlightened One, but the people beg for a prophet.\n"
"scribe: Inspire in me your will, and I shall carry your commandments to the faithful.\n"
"scribe: In the age before the Shattering, your sacred word came to us through relics.\n"
"scribe: If we are to hear your will once more, we must gather such relics.\n"
"scribe: I only pray that we be worthy enough to reclaim them."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: name
#: quests/main/phase1/1_15_relics/quest_main_1_15_relics.tres
msgid "The Relic"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: goals[]
#: quests/main/phase1/1_15_relics/quest_main_1_15_relics.tres
msgid "Find a <term_lower:relic> by completing <term_lower:event>s."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: record_title
#: quests/main/phase1/1_17_surveys/dlg_quest_main_1_17_surveys_begin.tres
msgid "Era 一: The Explorer"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: quests/main/phase1/1_17_surveys/dlg_quest_main_1_17_surveys_begin.tres
msgid ""
"PAGE: scribe(STUDIO_PRIMARY), explorer(STUDIO_SECONDARY)\n"
"explorer: I heard you're looking for explorers to help on the expeditions.\n"
"explorer: Well, here I am at your service!\n"
"scribe: You have my gratitude for answering the Enlightened One's call.\n"
"scribe: The journey of the faithful shall be arduous.\n"
"scribe: We will need skilled scouts to explore these new lands.\n"
"explorer: You're in luck!\n"
"explorer: That's exactly my specialty!\n"
"scribe: What you call luck is but a sign of the divine will.\n"
"scribe: Go now, with the Enlightened One's blessing."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: name
#: quests/main/phase1/1_17_surveys/quest_main_1_17_surveys.tres
msgid "Surveying the Shards"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: goals[]
#: quests/main/phase1/1_17_surveys/quest_main_1_17_surveys.tres
msgid "Finish a <term:survey>. Surveys happen after every 3 <term_lower:foray>s."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: record_title
#: quests/main/phase1/1_20_capital/dlg_quest_main_1_20_capital_begin.tres
msgid "Era 一: The Shard Capital"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: quests/main/phase1/1_20_capital/dlg_quest_main_1_20_capital_begin.tres
msgid ""
"PAGE: scribe(STUDIO_PRIMARY), explorer(STUDIO_SECONDARY)\n"
"explorer: The expedition was a success!\n"
"explorer: The shards are full of new adventures, new places to explore!\n"
"scribe: You have done the Enlightened One a great service.\n"
"scribe: The maps you bring shall serve us well in days to come.\n"
"\n"
"PAGE: scribe(SHRINE_PRIMARY), teo(SHRINE_SECONDARY)\n"
"scribe: Oh Enlightened One, the shards are ready to receive us.\n"
"scribe: On the next expedition, we shall raise a capital.\n"
"scribe: With that, the scattered can begin healing in earnest."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: record_title
#: quests/main/phase1/1_20_capital/dlg_quest_main_1_20_capital_end.tres
msgid "Era 一: The Shard Capital 二"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: quests/main/phase1/1_20_capital/dlg_quest_main_1_20_capital_end.tres
msgid ""
"PAGE: scribe(PORTAL_NETWORK), monk(GENERIC), AUDIENCE\n"
"scribe: See how swiftly that capital took root!\n"
"scribe: The people build, guided by divine strokes.\n"
"monk: It's only thanks to you that we know the Enlightened One's will.\n"
"monk: We'd be lost without you.\n"
"scribe: I only set down what is given.\n"
"scribe: With the Enlightened One's blessing, we have woven the first knot in a cord that will soon bind all shards.\n"
"scribe: Yet walls and fields alone will not hold us together.\n"
"scribe: Without memory, stone crumbles, and hope with it.\n"
"monk: Well, what should we do?\n"
"scribe: We must not only rebuild homes, but also preserve the sacred knowledge.\n"
"scribe: The Enlightened One grants us strokes of wisdom, but it is our duty to inscribe them, to carry them intact across every gate.\n"
"monk: We'll get ink and parchment at once!"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: name
#: quests/main/phase1/1_20_capital/quest_main_1_20_capital.tres
msgid "The Shard Capital"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: goals[]
#: quests/main/phase1/1_20_capital/quest_main_1_20_capital.tres
msgid "Establish the first <term:capital> after 6 <term_lower:foray>s."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: goals[]
#: quests/main/phase1/1_20_capital/quest_main_1_20_capital.tres
msgid "Finish the first <term:harmonization>."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: record_title
#: quests/main/phase1/1_25_crafting/dlg_quest_main_1_25_crafting_end.tres
msgid "Era 一: Preserved Wisdom"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: quests/main/phase1/1_25_crafting/dlg_quest_main_1_25_crafting_end.tres
msgid ""
"PAGE: scribe(SHRINE_PRIMARY), teo(SHRINE_SECONDARY)\n"
"scribe: Oh Enlightened One, we have begun sealing your wisdom in parchment and ink.\n"
"scribe: We shall carry these glyphs with us across the shards, so by your will, we may bring the world together once more.\n"
"\n"
"PAGE: scribe(STUDIO_PRIMARY), monk(STUDIO_SECONDARY)\n"
"scribe: I can feel divine grace resonating through the glyphs!\n"
"scribe: The world's restoration is close at hand.\n"
"monk: What's left for us to do now?\n"
"scribe: While ink preserves wisdom, without practice it is but a record.\n"
"scribe: We must raise shrines across the shards, so each day's breath carries the Enlightened One's teachings.\n"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: name
#: quests/main/phase1/1_25_crafting/quest_main_1_25_crafting.tres
msgid "Preserved Wisdom"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: goals[]
#: quests/main/phase1/1_25_crafting/quest_main_1_25_crafting.tres
msgid "Learn the <term:skill.craft_1_common> <term_lower:skill>."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: goals[]
#: quests/main/phase1/1_25_crafting/quest_main_1_25_crafting.tres
msgid "<term:craft> a <term_lower:glyph>."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: record_title
#: quests/main/phase1/1_30_shrines/dlg_quest_main_1_30_shrines_end.tres
msgid "Era 一: Strongholds of Faith"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: quests/main/phase1/1_30_shrines/dlg_quest_main_1_30_shrines_end.tres
msgid ""
"PAGE: scribe(SHRINE_PRIMARY), teo(SHRINE_SECONDARY)\n"
"scribe: The shrines rise like lanterns in the mist, each one a beacon calling your name, oh Enlightened One.\n"
"scribe: But we know that scattered sparks are not enough to mend the heavens.\n"
"scribe: One flame must stand above all others.\n"
"\n"
"PAGE: scribe(STUDIO_PRIMARY), explorer(STUDIO_SECONDARY)\n"
"scribe: I shall entrust you with a great duty, Explorer.\n"
"explorer: More surveys?\n"
"explorer: I'm always happy to visit new shards.\n"
"explorer: Each one is like its own little world!\n"
"scribe: They are but fragments of our past glories.\n"
"scribe: But not for much longer.\n"
"scribe: It is time for us to call upon the Enlightened One to reunite this shattered world.\n"
"scribe: We shall erect a single monument, vast and unshakable, a conduit for the divine power.\n"
"scribe: That shall be your mission.\n"
"scribe: A great expedition, greater than any launched before.\n"
"scribe: You shall prepare a shard to hold the great monastery, so the Enlightened One can walk among us again.\n"
"explorer: That is... a lot of responsibility."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: name
#: quests/main/phase1/1_30_shrines/quest_main_1_30_shrines.tres
msgid "Strongholds of Faith"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: goals[]
#: quests/main/phase1/1_30_shrines/quest_main_1_30_shrines.tres
msgid "Establish a Forest Shrine. You may require 50 <term:bonus.harmony> or 50 <term:bonus.safety> to achieve some outcomes."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: goals[]
#: quests/main/phase1/1_30_shrines/quest_main_1_30_shrines.tres
msgid "Afterwards, establish a Lake Island Shrine on a different shard."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: record_title
#: quests/main/phase1/1_40_dedication/dlg_quest_main_1_40_end.tres
msgid "Era 一: The Dedication"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: quests/main/phase1/1_40_dedication/dlg_quest_main_1_40_end.tres
msgid ""
"PAGE: scribe(NONE), monk(NONE)\n"
"scribe: We are ready to dedicate the great statue.\n"
"scribe: As the scripture tells us, when it reunites the shards, the Enlightened One shall walk among us, and all will be restored.\n"
"scribe: Once the expedition is finished, we shall begin the ritual."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: name
#: quests/main/phase1/1_40_dedication/quest_main_1_40_dedication.tres
msgid "The Dedication"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: goals[]
#: quests/main/phase1/1_40_dedication/quest_main_1_40_dedication.tres
msgid "Reach 150 total <term:bonus.harmony> during an <term_lower:run>."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: goals[]
#: quests/main/phase1/1_40_dedication/quest_main_1_40_dedication.tres
msgid "Establish a Monastery in a Forest, Mountain, or Canyon."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: record_title
#: quests/main/phase2/2_10_places_of_power/dlg_quest_main_2_10_places_of_power_begin.tres
msgid "Era 二: Places of Power"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: quests/main/phase2/2_10_places_of_power/dlg_quest_main_2_10_places_of_power_begin.tres
msgid ""
"PAGE: scribe(SHRINE_PRIMARY), teo(SHRINE_SECONDARY)\n"
"scribe: Oh Enlightened One, I prayed, and you were silent.\n"
"scribe: You promised to walk among us, yet we are still alone.\n"
"scribe: But I understand now.\n"
"scribe: You have already given us everything we needed in the sacred glyphs.\n"
"scribe: You were telling us to use your power to prepare, not just wait.\n"
"scribe: Well, use it we will!\n"
"scribe: Forgive me.\n"
"scribe: No more will I merely pray.\n"
"scribe: From this day on, I will act.\n"
"\n"
"PAGE: scribe(PORTAL_NETWORK), monk(GENERIC), AUDIENCE\n"
"scribe: Listen well!\n"
"scribe: The glyphs were instructions.\n"
"scribe: We, fools, mistook them for promises, but they are tools.\n"
"scribe: Tools we will use to focus the Enlightened One's power emanating through the great statue.\n"
"scribe: Each stroke touches a part of the world.\n"
"scribe: It was all in the old scrolls.\n"
"scribe: Air, earth, fire, [i]everything[/i] will obey our commands if we direct the energies right.\n"
"monk: The Enlightened One's energies?\n"
"scribe: No, no, the energies of the world!\n"
"scribe: They saturate the shards themselves, flowing with the rivers and knotting in old trees.\n"
"scribe: When we tap into them with the right glyphs, they come to life.\n"
"scribe: That is what makes our actions auspicious!\n"
"monk: But how do we know the rules?\n"
"scribe: The teachings give us the tools, but we must experiment if we are to wield them.\n"
"scribe: We will find the veins where the world's pulse is strongest, and we will strike.\n"
"\n"
"PAGE: historian(STUDIO_SECONDARY), scribe(STUDIO_PRIMARY)\n"
"historian: You preach as if you're sure, but what do we really know about these powers?\n"
"historian: What if they aren't so harmless?\n"
"scribe: We have no time to wait.\n"
"scribe: Every day the shards spread farther apart.\n"
"scribe: Inaction has failed us once, and I won't let it happen again!\n"
"historian: In that case I will write down what we find.\n"
"historian: If your plan fails, we'll need those lessons.\n"
"scribe: Very well!\n"
"scribe: Stay in your archive.\n"
"scribe: When you are ready to record the laws of the world, I will have carved them into the earth.\n"
"historian: At least our foolishness will be well documented..."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: record_title
#: quests/main/phase2/2_10_places_of_power/dlg_quest_main_2_10_places_of_power_end.tres
msgid "Era 二: Places of Power Found"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: quests/main/phase2/2_10_places_of_power/dlg_quest_main_2_10_places_of_power_end.tres
msgid ""
"PAGE: historian(STUDIO_SECONDARY), scribe(STUDIO_PRIMARY)\n"
"scribe: We return triumphant!\n"
"scribe: With our eyes uncovered, we finally see the Enlightened One's signs everywhere.\n"
"historian: You call it a triumph, but I hear the priests whisper about hauntings now.\n"
"historian: Food going bad overnight.\n"
"historian: Fever spreading across the settlements.\n"
"scribe: Yes, our powers have not gone unnoticed.\n"
"scribe: But every new path is bound to stir old dust.\n"
"historian: If the world is resisting, maybe we should listen.\n"
"scribe: These spirits are the lifeblood of the world seeping out.\n"
"scribe: We must act before they bleed it dry.\n"
"historian: We all want to fix the world, but these new powers...\n"
"historian: We don't really understand them yet.\n"
"scribe: Perhaps you are right.\n"
"scribe: I will study these hauntings.\n"
"scribe: Observe their responses to the glyphs.\n"
"historian: And with the Enlightened One's blessing, I'll be here to record the findings.\n"
"\n"
"PAGE: historian(MUSEUM_PRIMARY), explorer(MUSEUM_SECONDARY)\n"
"historian: The Scribe means well, but he is playing with fire.\n"
"explorer: I don't mind a little danger.\n"
"explorer: And these fox spirits they ran into sound fascinating.\n"
"explorer: I hope I get to meet one.\n"
"historian: Just... be careful out there."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: record_title
#: quests/main/phase2/2_10_places_of_power/dlg_quest_main_2_10_places_of_power_field.tres
msgid "Era 二: Places of Power: Endless Blossoms"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: quests/main/phase2/2_10_places_of_power/dlg_quest_main_2_10_places_of_power_field.tres
msgid ""
"PAGE: scribe(NONE)\n"
"scribe: I can feel the power of this place.\n"
"scribe: The essence of eternal spring flowing from the earth.\n"
"scribe: Yes... This is no accident. The wind, the scent... Everything follows an auspicious pattern. I feel the glyphs resonating.\n"
"scribe: We must capture the Stability essence of this place. Stability is what will bind the shards together."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: record_title
#: quests/main/phase2/2_10_places_of_power/dlg_quest_main_2_10_places_of_power_lanterns.tres
msgid "Era 二: Places of Power: Ghost Lanterns"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: quests/main/phase2/2_10_places_of_power/dlg_quest_main_2_10_places_of_power_lanterns.tres
msgid ""
"PAGE: scribe(NONE)\n"
"scribe: The dead still whisper through these lanterns.\n"
"scribe: This glowing path... It is a gateway of Change. A portal to powers from beyond our lifetimes.\n"
"scribe: If we are to bring our world back from the dead, we will need this. We must have the power to Change death to life."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: name
#: quests/main/phase2/2_10_places_of_power/quest_main_2_10_places_of_power.tres
msgid "Places of Power"
msgstr ""

