#. TRANSLATORS: Property: goals[]
#: quests/main/phase2/2_10_places_of_power/quest_main_2_10_places_of_power.tres
msgid "Find a procession of ghostly lanterns at the <spot:seashore>."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: goals[]
#: quests/main/phase2/2_10_places_of_power/quest_main_2_10_places_of_power.tres
msgid "Find an ancient glade in the <spot:forest>. You may require 100 <term:bonus.knowledge> or 100 <term:bonus.adventure> to achieve some outcomes."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: record_title
#: quests/main/phase2/2_20_hauntings/dlg_quest_main_2_20_hauntings_end.tres
msgid "Era 二: The Hauntings"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: text
#: quests/main/phase2/2_20_hauntings/dlg_quest_main_2_20_hauntings_end.tres
msgid ""
"PAGE: scribe(STUDIO_PRIMARY), historian(STUDIO_SECONDARY)\n"
"scribe: Our long studies are complete.\n"
"scribe: Every haunting followed the same law: appear, respond to the glyphs, then vanish.\n"
"historian: Laws, or patterns you chose to see?\n"
"scribe: Patterns that repeat are not coincidences.\n"
"scribe: The spirits answered us because we used the right incantations, in the right place, at the right time.\n"
"historian: How can we be certain it was your glyphs that pacified the spirits?\n"
"scribe: The glyphs, the incantations...\n"
"scribe: They are merely tools to channel the Enlightened One's powers.\n"
"scribe: But it is not just the old records.\n"
"scribe: I have seen the miracles myself.\n"
"historian: Let's assume you're right.\n"
"historian: I can see in your eyes that you have grander designs for these powers.\n"
"historian: What's your plan?\n"
"scribe: To bring the shards back together, of course!\n"
"scribe: Ever since we started on this path, we have dreamed of it.\n"
"scribe: I will be the one to bring it about.\n"
"\n"
"PAGE: scribe(SHRINE_PRIMARY), teo(SHRINE_SECONDARY)\n"
"scribe: I have studied your glyphs until the ink blurred before my eyes.\n"
"scribe: All I need is a sign from you, in these, the holiest of the scriptures.\n"
"scribe: \"Together\"\n"
"scribe: \"Strength\"\n"
"scribe: \"Focus\"\n"
"scribe: Use all of the glyphs at the same time?\n"
"scribe: No, that can't be...\n"
"scribe: Maybe meditate together on our strength?\n"
"scribe: I see!\n"
"scribe: The places of power.\n"
"scribe: We must find a shard with all of them!\n"
"scribe: Yes, then we can focus their energies.\n"
"scribe: That will be a nexus to draw the other shards closer.\n"
"scribe: Thank you, oh Enlightened One!\n"
"scribe: Our path is clear now."
msgstr ""

