msgid "Silk Weaver's Hut"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: description
#: stage/spots/brushland/upgrade_brushland_2_silk_weaver_hut.tres
msgid "Once the moths emerge, discarded cocoons are put to use. Not as shiny as the silk of yore, but spares the residents."
msgstr ""

