msgid "Adventurers Guild"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: description
#: stage/spots/building_large/upgrade_building_large_2_adventurer_guild.tres
msgid "The restless and the daring gather here, eager to plan forays and share tall tales."
msgstr ""

