msgid "Merchant Guild Hall"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: description
#: stage/spots/building_large/upgrade_building_large_2_merchant_hall.tres
msgid "Silver tongues and shrewd eyes fill the hall, comparing prices and charting routes that criss-cross the shard."
msgstr ""

