#. TRANSLATORS: Property: description
#: stage/spots/building_large/upgrade_building_large_3_artisans_college.tres
msgid "The crafts mastered here are rooted in the traditions of the Old World, and perfected through tireless innovation to fit the new reality."
msgstr ""

