msgid "Admire the snow."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Property: outcome_text
#: stage/survey/episodes/episode_winter_wonderland.tres
msgid ""
"The group decides to sit by the fire and admire the wonderful view around them.\n"
"\n"
"They stay until the embers turn to ash."
msgstr ""

